# Business cards (`/business-cards`)

## Authority

1. **VIP-style duplex** implemented in [`business-cards-press-specs.tsx`](mdc:src/components/business-cards-press-specs.tsx) — forest front with gold fleet cutout; forest back with crest, social icons, CODE128 barcode.
2. **`business-card/Golf-Sol-Ireland-Business-Card.pdf`** — supplementary print proof only.

React + PDF export on `/business-cards` is the live source of truth (not static PNG tiles unless regenerated deliberately).

## Required faces

### Operations — Martin Kelly & Greg McDonald (eight faces)

Portrait + landscape × front + back each. Spec IDs: `portrait-front`, `greg-portrait-front`, etc.

VIP duplex: forest front + barcode back — see [`business-cards-press-specs.tsx`](mdc:src/components/business-cards-press-specs.tsx).

### Executive — Tommy O'Shea (two faces)

Landscape only:

1. `tommy-luxury-front` — emerald Celtic texture, gold foil crest, chauffeur + golf lockup  
2. `tommy-luxury-back` — executive contact, premium QR → `https://golfsolirl.com`, NFC accent  

See [`business-cards-tommy-luxury.tsx`](mdc:src/components/business-cards-tommy-luxury.tsx). Palette in `businessCardLuxuryPalette`. Print SVG overlays in `public/business-cards/tommy-luxury/`.

## Front (forest + gold cutout)

- Background: deep forest `#063B2A` / `#03150f`.
- **Gold panel** top-left (portrait) or left column (landscape) with **fleet lineup** photo (`BRAND_FLEET_LINEUP_IMAGE_SRC`) in a clipped inset.
- Small **crest** (`GOLFSOL_BRAND_LOGO_HOSTED`).
- Diagonal **GOLF SOL IRELAND** in `font-ge-display`.
- **Name** + **Operations** (Martin Kelly vs Greg McDonald only person difference).
- Gold rule divider.
- Contact icons (Lucide): IE phone, ES phone, email, web, **Dublin · Costa del Sol** — from `businessCardContact` + corridor line.

## Back (forest + barcode)

- Solid forest field `#03150f`.
- Large centred **crest** + **GOLF SOL IRELAND**.
- Social row from `businessCardSocialLinks` (LinkedIn, Facebook, WhatsApp, Bluesky — same as site footer).
- **CODE128 barcode** encoding `businessCardBarcodeValue` (`https://www.golfsolirl.com`) via `BusinessCardBarcode` + `jsbarcode`. **No QR code.**

## Landscape behaviour

- **Front:** fleet/gold panel **left ~38%**, identity + contact **right** — do not only rotate portrait.
- **Back:** crest + brand **left column**, social + barcode **right column**.

## Data

- People: `businessCardPerson`, `businessCardPersonGreg` in [`business-cards-config.ts`](mdc:src/lib/business-cards-config.ts).
- Contact: `businessCardContact`.
- Social: `businessCardSocialLinks` (imports `footerSocialLinks`).
- Barcode: `businessCardBarcodeValue`.

## PDF export

Hidden `#business-cards-pdf-export-root` must expose one `[data-pdf-page]` block per spec ID for `save-business-cards-pdf.ts`. Front and back must render **different** components (`VipStyleCardFront` vs `VipStyleCardBack`).

---

When editing this page, preserve VIP duplex fidelity — spacing and colour tweaks only, not a new creative direction unless product asks.
